@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api


### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json


### 用户注册
# @name register
# 使用测试账户注册；默认管理员 QuantAdmin 由应用启动时自动创建，重复注册会返回 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}


### 用户登录
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "QuantAdmin",
  "password": "Quant.Admin"
}


### 刷新令牌
# @name refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.refreshToken}}


### 用户登出
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.data.refreshToken}}"
}


### 获取用户信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### 修改密码
# oldPassword 须为当前账户密码（登录示例用的是默认管理员 Quant.Admin）
# 执行成功后所有 refreshToken 失效，刷新令牌示例需重新登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{
  "oldPassword": "Quant.Admin",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword@456"
}


### 登出所有设备
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### ========== 通达信 TDX 接口 ==========
# 直连通达信行情服务器；注意：价格字段单位为「厘」(元 × 1000)


### TDX - 获取K线（日线，最近 100 根）
GET {{baseUrl}}/tdx/kline/600036?period=day&count=100
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### TDX - 获取K线（周线）
GET {{baseUrl}}/tdx/kline/600036?period=week&count=50
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### TDX - 批量获取五档盘口
POST {{baseUrl}}/tdx/quotes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{
  "codes": [
    "600036",
    "000001",
    "sh601318"
  ]
}


### TDX - 获取当日分时
GET {{baseUrl}}/tdx/minute/600036
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### TDX - 获取历史分时
GET {{baseUrl}}/tdx/minute/600036/history?date=20260914
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### TDX - 获取当日分笔成交
GET {{baseUrl}}/tdx/trade/600036?count=50
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### TDX - 获取历史分笔成交
GET {{baseUrl}}/tdx/trade/600036/history?date=20260914&count=50
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### TDX - 获取上海证券交易所证券数量
GET {{baseUrl}}/tdx/stocks/sh/count
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### TDX - 获取深圳证券交易所证券数量
GET {{baseUrl}}/tdx/stocks/sz/count
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### TDX - 获取上海证券交易所全量证券列表（自动分页，响应较大）
GET {{baseUrl}}/tdx/stocks/sh
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### ========== 证券数据（WeStock）==========
# 内部通过子进程调用 src/scripts/westock-data-clawhub.mjs，单次约 400ms


### WeStock - 搜索证券代码（不传 scope 时含股票与基金）
GET {{baseUrl}}/westock/search?keyword=腾讯
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### WeStock - 只搜股票
GET {{baseUrl}}/westock/search?keyword=银行&scope=stock
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### WeStock - 只搜基金
GET {{baseUrl}}/westock/search?keyword=银行&scope=fund
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### WeStock - 搜索无结果（仍返回 200，rows 为空数组）
GET {{baseUrl}}/westock/search?keyword=zzz不存在
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### WeStock - 当日分时
GET {{baseUrl}}/westock/minute?code=sh600519
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### WeStock - 五日分时（比当日多一列 date）
GET {{baseUrl}}/westock/minute?code=sh600519&days=5
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### WeStock - 日 K 线（上限 1000 即约 4 年日线；更长历史需用 start/end 分段取）
GET {{baseUrl}}/westock/kline?code=sh600519&limit=1000
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### WeStock - 分钟 K 线（注意是 m5 而非 5m；不传日期时上游只返回当天分钟数据）
GET {{baseUrl}}/westock/kline?code=sh600519&period=m15&limit=240&start=2026-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### WeStock - 后复权
GET {{baseUrl}}/westock/kline?code=sh600519&fq=hfq&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### WeStock - 多代码（columns 多一个 code 列）
GET {{baseUrl}}/westock/kline?code=sh600519,hk00700&limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}